# vegas26 FocalTech "double-tap" input device: the touch driver reports a double tap on the
# screen-off panel as KEY_F4 (62). Fallback only: the vendor sensor HAL (sensors.moto.so)
# EVIOCGRABs this device and turns it into the "dt-gesture" sensor, which SystemUI Doze uses.
# This layout only matters if that HAL is not running.
key 62    WAKEUP
key 59    WAKEUP
